<title>ITALY: Gross yield 6.45 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 6.45 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 26.0 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.45%     (6.56)    98.40	  (98.39)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.40%     (6.48)    96.89	  (96.87)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.33%     (6.68)    94.05	  (93.75)</p>
<p>Note: Results compare with a previous auction on June 11.</p>
</text>
